gories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","review_id":"dIMHcerShj7mrUvMV7UEFw","date":"2013-09-28T04:13:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.941685140132904,"text_excerpt":"I can't believe I haven't reviewed this place yet! I don't get up to Mid-city too often, but when I do I often end up at Bayou Beer Garden. The interior is a bit smoky for me, but luckily there is the excellent back porch. The back porch is VERY spacious - an excellent location for a weeknight get-together with friends. Every time I come back the beer selection gets better. Also, one time I was here I happened to catch a 610 Stompers rehearsal which was nothing short of magical."},{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","review_id":"q-XIZ6Tei2uwG6FD5oWZJQ","date":"2014-11-03T22:22:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9415702819824219,"text_excerpt":"Great selection of beer and other drinks. Amazing outdoor seating. The place looks so small from the front and then opens out into a huge outdoor bar and seating area. Nice place to grab a beer and some bar food on a Friday afternoon which is what my friend and I did. You could tell it was a popular mid-city place and more laid back than some of the douchy places you'll find elsewhere in the city"},{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","review_id":"81uSGyHnBoPIzLs8_JenxA","date":"2020-03-31T03:00:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9387838840484619,"text_excerpt":"Such a fun spot to grab a beer from their wide selection (don't worry wino's, they are adjacent to Bayou Wine Garden so everyone is happy!) of beer on tap or bottled. Prices are great but the win of the day is the crawfish boil they have right outside on their parking lot. IT'S SO GOOD. They have it boiled down to a T, and are pushing out plenty of to-go containers. BBG is a great spot for hanging out with friends and loved ones. I can't wait to go back and support once we're cleared to hang out in public spaces."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","photo_id":"DFyBvKtsOk6HlDVcOjBvVg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/DFyBvKtsOk6HlDVcOjBvVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8740387558937073},{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","photo_id":"stiEKlZrJvIZyOzl83DSZg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/stiEKlZrJvIZyOzl83DSZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8707479238510132},{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","photo_id":"ShwZyX1kj1VKEcbWLGL_9w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ShwZyX1kj1VKEcbWLGL_9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8565061092376709},{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","photo_id":"n520II_ZgGfAIc3PotzdXA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/n520II_ZgGfAIc3PotzdXA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8375385999679565},{"business_id":"A0RSdFWqs-keuOogaMjZ4w","photo_id":"NLlYMhT51T8X4niEzBTJ0w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NLlYMhT51T8X4niEzBTJ0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7945781946182251}]},"notebook_case":null}
